    "name": "Nitro Battle Racing",
    "steam_appid": 3564440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564440/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1750451360\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Overtake and blast away your opponents in Nitro Battle Racing! In this arcade action racer, you will compete in exhilarating races either against AI, or your friends in up to 4-player split-screen multiplayer. <br><br>Race in a wide variety of environments! From dry deserts to neon lit cyberspace, and even all the way to mars, there is no telling where your racing career will take you.<br><br>Collect random powerups with race defining abilities such as the Rocket Booster which has enough power to pull you to the front of the pack. <br><br>Pick your favorite vehicle out of 12 unique karts each boasting their own unique stats to fit your preferred racing playstyle. Choose your favorite drift ability and play your way, whether you prefer to play aggressively with the Gatling Gun, defensively with your own Repair Tool, or simply want to zoom past your opponents with the Drift Boost. Whatever you choose just make sure you leave your opponents in the dust!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564440/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1750451360\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up To 4-Player Local Split-Screen races <br></li><li>12 Unique Karts and 3 Unique Drift Abilities <br></li><li>9+ Random Powerups <br></li><li>6 Unlockable Stages<br></li><li>3 Difficulty Options for AI</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564440/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1750451360\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564440/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1750451360\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Overtake and blast away your opponents in Nitro Battle Racing! In this arcade action racer, you will compete in exhilarating races either against AI, or your friends in up to 4-player split-screen multiplayer. <br><br>Race in a wide variety of environments! From dry deserts to neon lit cyberspace, and even all the way to mars, there is no telling where your racing career will take you.<br><br>Collect random powerups with race defining abilities such as the Rocket Booster which has enough power to pull you to the front of the pack. <br><br>Pick your favorite vehicle out of 12 unique karts each boasting their own unique stats to fit your preferred racing playstyle. Choose your favorite drift ability and play your way, whether you prefer to play aggressively with the Gatling Gun, defensively with your own Repair Tool, or simply want to zoom past your opponents with the Drift Boost. Whatever you choose just make sure you leave your opponents in the dust!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564440/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1750451360\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up To 4-Player Local Split-Screen races <br></li><li>12 Unique Karts and 3 Unique Drift Abilities <br></li><li>9+ Random Powerups <br></li><li>6 Unlockable Stages<br></li><li>3 Difficulty Options for AI</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564440/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1750451360\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "short_description": "Overtake and blast away your opponents in Nitro Battle Racing! In this arcade action racer, you will compete in exhilarating races using a variety of powerups and abilities to surpass the competition. Unlock new maps through your accomplishments and become the ultimate racer.",
